@meeting train.m15.calder
// Pillar 5 Step 4, M15 rewiring (Day 17, Wednesday morning): Calder at a junction in the officers' corridor. Seat E2.
title: Rewiring
from: Chief Ines Calder
gist: Calder showed you rewiring: match each wire to the chart, test, and if a fuse pops, redo only that pair.
== lines
calder: Junction box. Open it. Don't touch anything yet.   [gesture]
calder > you: The chart says which goes where. Match the colours. Pair by pair.
calder: Then test. If a fuse pops, that pair's wrong. Only that pair. Swap it.
calder: Nothing here bites if you test first. Test first.
? choice
* What if the colours have faded?   rel:calder+2 flavour:practical
  calder: Then you switch things off one at a time and see what goes dark. Later. Today they're fresh.
* Pair by pair. Got it.   rel:calder+1
  calder: Good. Begin.
